    "updated_at": "2019-10-17T11:37:35Z",
    "body": "Just my 2 cents: I would have preferred to start with Serde due to the Pros you have listed. But now I don't see it worth to switch it back again. My gut feeling would be to stick with the current approach and switch it up when we see actual problems with it. But maybe we are also missing a major con of the current approach in this discussion?",
